; gshim.def — exports for the proxy glide2x.dll (38 total).
; Names + arities (@N) from the EU exe IAT (2026-10-10, static fact;
; verified: 38 named, 0 ordinal-only, 0 undecorated) and arity-checked
; against the Glide 2.x SDK headers (sezero/glide, FX_CALL=__stdcall).
; The REAL renamed DLL's exports are verified directly (V-1b), never
; assumed from the exe's imports.
;  - 35 pass-through imports: pure forwarder exports (no code).
;  - 3 intercepted calls: mismatch-alias exports "decorated"=internal
;    with the internal name WITHOUT the leading underscore (F-3 H4a,
;    PC-verified 38-exact 2026-10-11). Bare and exact-match spellings
;    do NOT link with MinGW-32; undecorated exports the wrong names.
;    gshim.c carries NO dllexport annotation: MinGW-32 dllexport emits
;    the underscore-less spelling as extra twins (38+3 — the 1f88513
;    failure). V-1 byte-verifies the exact 38; test_def.py enforces
;    both halves statically. See TESTING (F-3 record).
LIBRARY glide2x
